      "ja": "信管（爆破薬包の点火装置Ｆ４２Ｂ３／１０；化学的事項Ｃ０６Ｃ）；安全解除機構または安全機構（信管の組み立てＦ４２Ｂ３３／０２；信管の中へ，または中からの火管の装着または取り外しＦ４２Ｂ３３／０４；信管用容器Ｆ４２Ｂ３９／３０）",
      "en": "AMMUNITION FUZES (blasting cartridge initiators F42B3/10; chemical aspects C06C); ARMING OR SAFETY MEANS THEREFOR (filling fuzes F42B33/02; fitting or extracting primers in or from fuzes F42B33/04; containers for fuzes F42B39/30)<br><br><u>WARNING</u><br><br>In this subclass non-limiting references (in the sense of paragraph 39 of the Guide to the IPC) may still be displayed in the scheme.",
